#### 10. Ignored / Disabled Test — `disabledTest()`

**Lines 108–113.** The test is annotated with `@Disabled("flaky, fix later")`. The reason text ("flaky, fix later") has no issue tracker reference, making it likely the test will remain disabled indefinitely.

